# Mínimo de 32 caracteres. Usada para selar a sessão no servidor.
# Local Nuxt / .env — at least 32 characters.
#
# Cloudflare Workers Builds (npm run build + npx wrangler deploy):
# 1. Add the same name as a Worker Secret / Variable in the dashboard, AND
# 2. Prefer also adding it under Build settings → Variables (so build + runtime see it).
# 3. Each wrangler deploy can wipe dashboard vars unless keep_vars is enabled
#    (see nuxt.config.ts nitro.cloudflare.wrangler.keep_vars).
# 4. Root directory must be the repo root (where package.json lives), usually empty / "/".
NUXT_SESSION_PASSWORD=change-this-to-a-long-random-string-please
